    <string name="role_help_title">If the role cannot be assigned</string>
    <string name="role_help_text">In the system “Caller ID &amp; spam app” dialog pick CallGuard. If you pick Phone, the role stays with Google Phone and the filter will not work.\n\nManually: Settings → Apps → Default apps → Caller ID &amp; spam app → CallGuard.</string>
    <string name="role_dialog_title">Role not granted</string>
    <string name="role_dialog_message">Pick CallGuard in the system dialog, not Phone. While the role belongs to Google Phone, Android does not pass calls to the app, so calls go through and the journal stays empty.\n\nManually: Settings → Apps → Default apps → Caller ID &amp; spam app → CallGuard.</string>
