    <string name="about_install_file_hint">If you downloaded the APK manually, pick it here and Android will install the update over the current version. The journal and settings are kept.</string>
    <string name="about_privacy">The network is used for one thing only: checking updates on GitHub — one request to api.github.com and the APK download from there. No data about calls, contacts or the journal is ever sent; the app has no such logic.\n\nThe journal, allow list and settings stay on your phone.</string>
